<title>USA: Source One Mortgage Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Source One Mortgage Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Source One Mortgage Services Corp said Wednesday it had net income of $8.3 million in the third quarter, including a $6.6 million after-tax gain from the sale of servicing.</p>
<p>The company had net income of $4.8 million in the 1995 third quarter.</p>
<p>Nine-month income for the 1996 period was $27.5 million, up from $22 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>The mortgage banking company did not provide per-share or revenue results.</p>
</text>
